      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It appears this isn't fixed and still is easily reproducible. A member of the team mentioned that the fixed should be in already, and recommended me to open up a new canny for visibility. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/world-ui-in-some-worlds-causes-ui-in-other-worlds-to-break",
